      "created_at": "2015-01-15T19:52:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've had a suspicion that a hero die in the arc of the final expansion of SotM, but I sincerely hope it isn't NightMist. I'd really like her to still be around. If not for myself, for my friend who mains NightMist. Plus, I'd really like to be able to pit Dark Watch against the other hero teams in a fair 5v5 match, and if NightMist is gone, that just won't happen. So I'm holding onto a five-hero team of DW, at least in the Tactics timeline.</p>",
